  "idea": "Greenshot: lightweight screenshot utility with instant annotation tools",
  "text": "The tiny free app that makes team communications ten times clearer. Remote teams waste valuable hours deciphering vague bug reports and disorganized screenshots dumped into shared communication channels. Unannotated screen captures force developers to guess exact error triggers, browser settings, and user click sequences. Greenshot instantly captures active windows, stamps numbered action badges, highlights error notices, and exports straight to Jira tickets. Accelerate your engineering handoffs without communication bottlenecks.",
